"poetry":   {
    "0":"Beneath the soil, I lie and wait,<br>A name erased by hands of fate.<br>The stars still burn, but not for me,<br>I sleep beneath eternity.",
    "1":"The ticking stops, yet time decays, <br>Within these walls, the silence stays. <br>A thousand screams behind one door, <br>What once was life returns no more.",
    "2":"They sang my name in tongues of dust, <br>While maggots danced in sacred rust. <br>My cradle rocked in graves of stone, <br>With marrow hymns and shrieking bone. <br>The light withdrew, ashamed to see, <br>What love became inside of me.",
    "3":"I stitched my faith from cursed skin,<br>And drank the dark that bloomed within.<br>Each heartbeat hums a blasphemed verse,<br>Of holy rot and sainted curse.<br>No one shall claim this husk I wear.<br>I crowned myself in black despair.",
    "4":"Beneath the veil where shadows creep,<br>The dead still mutter in their sleep.<br>I hear them whisper through the seams,<br>Bleeding sorrow into dreams.<br>Their hands reach up to drag me down,<br>And I descend without a crown.",
    "5":"The altar weeps in crimson tide,<br>Where once a soul refused to hide.<br>I offered fear and spoke in moans,<br>Then cracked my truth through brittle bones.<br>My future burned, a sick divine,<br>And now the ruin’s fully mine.",
    "6":"This skin remembers every scar,<br>Each whispered sin, each fallen star.<br>The mirror cracks, but shows me still,<br>A soul grown sharp enough to kill.",
    "7":"My breath is smoke, my thoughts are coal,<br>A shrine of flame where burned the soul.<br>The night is kind, the light deceives,<br>I found my truth where no one grieves."
},



